      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Teal Rule",
        "body": "The old blue-teal palette is retired. New rules never use `--panel`, `--rule`, `--rule-hi`, `--select` or the `#0d1326`-family blues; existing uses are migrated to the gold tokens.",
